\* All TLC check configs for AntflyNodeDrainLifecycle.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyNodeDrainLifecycle.tla.

SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyFinalizeActiveNode = FALSE
    BuggyRegistrationClearsDrain = FALSE
    BuggySafeIgnoresPlacementDebt = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    DrainStateConsistent
    FinalizeRequiresDrained
    SafeReportMatchesDebt
    TerminationSafe
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    DrainEventuallyReportsSafe

==== BadFinalizeActive
\* Expected-failure config: finalize accepted while the node is still active.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyFinalizeActiveNode = TRUE
    BuggyRegistrationClearsDrain = FALSE
    BuggySafeIgnoresPlacementDebt = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    FinalizeRequiresDrained

==== BadRegistrationClearsDrain
\* Expected-failure config: node re-registration resets lifecycle to active
\* while hosted stores keep drain_requested (historical regression guarded by
\* normalizeNodeRegistrationDrainIntentTxn). Pinned to drain consistency.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyFinalizeActiveNode = FALSE
    BuggyRegistrationClearsDrain = TRUE
    BuggySafeIgnoresPlacementDebt = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    DrainStateConsistent

==== BadSafeIgnoresDebt
\* Expected-failure config: safe_to_terminate reported while placement/hosted
\* debt remains; the operator terminates a node that still hosts replicas.
\* Pinned to the status-computation invariant.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyFinalizeActiveNode = FALSE
    BuggyRegistrationClearsDrain = FALSE
    BuggySafeIgnoresPlacementDebt = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    SafeReportMatchesDebt
